<title>UK: Electra Fleming, AB Asesores sign deal.</title>
<headline>Electra Fleming, AB Asesores sign deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venture capital fund Electra Fleming Investment Trust Plc said on Tuesday that it had signed an arrangement with AB Asesores, a Madrid-based investment bank, to invest in private equity in Spain.</p>
<p>The firms did not specify how much they planned to invest. Spain's private equity market has been witnessing a steady boost over the last two years after a long period of slow growth.</p>
<p>Electra Fleming is jointly owned by by Electra Investment Trust and Robert Fleming Bank.</p>
<p>Electra Fleming has recently made significant investments in British industry including Virgin Rail group and in a management buyout for engineering firm William Cook.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
